"'''Storm Over Ryloth'''" is the nineteenth episode of [[The Clone Wars: Season One|Season One]] of the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' television series. It is the nineteenth episode of the series overall and is the first of a three-part storyline.

==Official description==
''Ahsoka disobeys Anakin's orders and loses most of her squadron - prompting Anakin to help give his Padawan a lesson in a respect for authority, and the opportunity for redemption.''

==Opening narration==
{{OpeningCrawl
|name=Episode 19<br />STORM OVER RYLOTH
|text=Planet Ryloth invaded! Subjected
